- MailHog in Compose - judges watch 30 payslip emails land,\n-   with zero deliverability risk. A .env switch points at real SMTP.\n- WeasyPrint runs in the Linux container, never on Windows.\n-   GTK on Win 11 is a real time sink. Fallback: fpdf2.", "originalText": "- MailHog in Compose - judges watch 30 payslip emails land,\n-   with zero deliverability risk. A .env switch points at real SMTP.\n- WeasyPrint runs in the Linux container, never on Windows.\n-   GTK on Win 11 is a real time sink. Fallback: fpdf2.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "e00151", "type": "text", "x": 1664, "y": 1424.5, "width": 258.8, "height": 18.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 382817798, "version": 12, "versionNonce": 1614735624, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1757000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "CONTRACT-FIRST WORKING AGREEMENT", "originalText": "CONTRACT-FIRST WORKING AGREEMENT", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e00152", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1660, "y": 1450.5, "width": 840, "height": 127.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1076344157, "version": 12, "versionNonce": 318438960, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1757000000000, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e00153", "type": "text", "x": 1680, "y": 1468.5, "width": 800, "height": 87.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 641910674, "version": 12, "versionNonce": 1856836129, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1757000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "- Hour 0-2: schemas written, every router stubbed with fixtures.\n- openapi.json is the single source of truth; Pranav generates\n-   the TS client and builds against MSW mocks from those types.\n- Result: the frontend is never blocked on backend logic - the\n-   most common two-person hackathon failure, removed by design.", "originalText": "- Hour 0-2: schemas written, every router stubbed with fixtures.\n- openapi.json is the single source of truth; Pranav generates\n-   the TS client and builds against MSW mocks from those types.\n- Result: the frontend is never blocked on backend logic - the\n-   most common two-person hackathon failure, removed by design.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "e00154", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1660, "y": 1640.0, "width": 840, "height": 292, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1227627134, "version": 12, "versionNonce": 1312452543, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1757000000000, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e00155", "type": "text", "x": 1686, "y": 1662.0, "width": 182.83, "height": 16.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1369245784, "version": 12, "versionNonce": 1300358103, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1757000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "SCALE, SIZED FOR THE BRIEF", "originalText": "SCALE, SIZED FOR THE BRIEF", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e00156", "type": "line", "x": 1686, "y": 1688.0, "width": 788, "height": 0.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 60, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 2}, "seed": 1048303779, "version": 12, "versionNonce": 1624391357, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1757000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0.0], [788, 0.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null}, {"id": "e00157", "type": "text", "x": 1686, "y": 1704.0, "width": 364.404, "height": 52.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 195866283, "version": 12, "versionNonce": 1448651606, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1757000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "500 employees  x  1 monthly payrun\n= 500 payslips  x  ~12 lines  =  6,000 rows\ntarget: compute under 5 seconds", "originalText": "500 employees  x  1 monthly payrun\n= 500 payslips  x  ~12 lines  =  6,000 rows\ntarget: compute under 5 seconds", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e00158", "type": "text", "x": 1686, "y": 1786.0, "width": 788, "height": 35.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5c5f66", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1467426950, "version": 12, "versionNonce": 840800890, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1757000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "The naive version does 500 x 4 queries and crawls. Pre-load in 3 bulk queries keyed into dicts before the\nloop, then bulk_save_objects for the lines.", "originalText": "The naive version does 500 x 4 queries and crawls. Pre-load in 3 bulk queries keyed into dicts before the\nloop, then bulk_save_objects for the lines.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "e00159", "type": "text", "x": 1686, "y": 1864.0, "width": 514.904, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 85798368, "version": 12, "versionNonce": 1702048085, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1757000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "indexes: contract(employee,state,dates) · attendance(employee,check_in)\n         time_off_request(employee,state,from) · payslip(payrun)", "originalText": "indexes: contract(employee,state,dates) · attendance(employee,check_in)\n         time_off_request(employee,state,from) · payslip(payrun)", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e00160", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2560, "y": 1124.0, "width": 840, "height": 232, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1916512529, "version": 12, "versionNonce": 1392729750, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1757000000000, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e00161", "type": "text", "x": 2586, "y": 1146.0, "width": 127.19000000000001, "height": 16.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 676511511, "version": 12, "versionNonce": 1085218694, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1757000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "OWNERSHIP BOUNDARY", "originalText": "OWNERSHIP BOUNDARY", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e00162", "type": "line", "x": 2586, "y": 1172.0, "width": 788, "height": 0.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 60, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 2}, "seed": 1662410772, "version": 12, "versionNonce": 970465226, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1757000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0.0], [788, 0.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null}, {"id": "e00163", "type": "text", "x": 2586, "y": 1188.0, "width": 788, "height": 18.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5c5f66", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1038114457, "version": 12, "versionNonce": 982767250, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1757000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Aditya owns backend/ and openapi.json. Pranav owns frontend/src/. Neither edits the other's tree.", "originalText": "Aditya owns backend/ and openapi.json. Pranav owns frontend/src/. Neither edits the other's tree.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "e00164", "type": "text", "x": 2586, "y": 1252.0, "width": 788, "height": 37.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5c5f66", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 193823751, "version": 12, "versionNonce": 225000667, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1757000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Any contract change is one appended line in docs/api-contract.md plus a ping. No silent drift, no\nmerge archaeology at hour 30.", "originalText": "Any contract change is one appended line in docs/api-contract.md plus a ping. No silent drift, no\nmerge archaeology at hour 30.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "e00165", "type": "text", "x": 2586, "y": 1320.0, "width": 398.116, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2131188703, "version": 12, "versionNonce": 193765852, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1757000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "openapi.json  =  the only interface that exists", "originalText": "openapi.json  =  the only interface that exists", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e00166", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2560, "y": 1396.0, "width": 840, "height": 575.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "#f3f0ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1