namespaces only", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e00402", "type": "text", "x": 1920, "y": 3352.25, "width": 49.080000000000005, "height": 13.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 460549433, "version": 12, "versionNonce": 1784142961, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1757000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "REJECTED", "originalText": "REJECTED", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e00403", "type": "text", "x": 1920, "y": 3372.25, "width": 334.304, "height": 60.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 315885666, "version": 12, "versionNonce": 1420938577, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1757000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Import · Lambda · Subscript · comprehensions\nAttribute on arbitrary objects · dunder access\n__import__ · open · exec\nevaluated with __builtins__ = {}", "originalText": "Import · Lambda · Subscript · comprehensions\nAttribute on arbitrary objects · dunder access\n__import__ · open · exec\nevaluated with __builtins__ = {}", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e00404", "type": "line", "x": 1446, "y": 3484.25, "width": 888, "height": 0.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 40, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 2}, "seed": 2130395030, "version": 12, "versionNonce": 671860849, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1757000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0.0], [888, 0.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null}, {"id": "e00405", "type": "text", "x": 1446, "y": 3500.25, "width": 888, "height": 35.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1638052928, "version": 12, "versionNonce": 927599974, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1757000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Errors are caught per rule: the line records amount = 0 plus a RULE_EVAL_FAILED warning, so one bad formula never\nkills a whole payrun.", "originalText": "Errors are caught per rule: the line records amount = 0 plus a RULE_EVAL_FAILED warning, so one bad formula never\nkills a whole payrun.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "e00406", "type": "text", "x": 2424, "y": 3190.25, "width": 250.775, "height": 18.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 677886574, "version": 12, "versionNonce": 1699321369, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1757000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "THE LINE THAT DECIDES THE SCORE", "originalText": "THE LINE THAT DECIDES THE SCORE", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e00407", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2420, "y": 3216.25, "width": 980, "height": 180.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1441846256, "version": 12, "versionNonce": 1544116253, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1757000000000, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e00408", "type": "text", "x": 2440, "y": 3234.25, "width": 940, "height": 140.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1004964642, "version": 12, "versionNonce": 867576445, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1757000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "- 'Implement business rules in application logic rather than\n-   using hardcoded values.'\n- A judge tests it by editing HRA 40% -> 50%, hitting Compute,\n-   and watching net salary move.\n- If that works we pass. If HRA is a constant in payroll_engine.py\n-   we fail regardless of how the UI looks.\n- Build requirement: the seeded set must be deletable. Demo beat -\n-   delete a rule, recompute, watch the payslip line vanish.", "originalText": "- 'Implement business rules in application logic rather than\n-   using hardcoded values.'\n- A judge tests it by editing HRA 40% -> 50%, hitting Compute,\n-   and watching net salary move.\n- If that works we pass. If HRA is a constant in payroll_engine.py\n-   we fail regardless of how the UI looks.\n- Build requirement: the seeded set must be deletable. Demo beat -\n-   delete a rule, recompute, watch the payslip line vanish.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "e00409", "type": "text", "x": 0, "y": 3734.25, "width": 18.05, "height": 18.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f08c00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1199311195, "version": 12, "versionNonce": 312697970, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1757000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "05", "originalText": "05", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e00410", "type": "text", "x": 0, "y": 3756.25, "width": 656.84, "height": 42.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1197116093, "version": 12, "versionNonce": 17495145, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1757000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Payrun lifecycle & the warning gates", "originalText": "Payrun lifecycle & the warning gates", "fontSize": 34, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e00411", "type": "text", "x": 0, "y": 3806.75, "width": 1800, "height": 18.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5c5f66", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1099280527, "version": 12, "versionNonce": 1817226561, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1757000000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "State transitions are gated in the service layer, never in the router. This is also the demo's best beat: the system stops you before you pay someone wrong.", "originalText": "State transitions are gated in the service layer, nev